&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Trading teams to bring new features to market with clarity and speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own product launch communications and adoption strategy across institutional audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
