&lt;li&gt;Proven background securing platforms within FinTech, Web3, and digital asset ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong engineering proficiency in distributed systems, microservices, and languages such as Python or Java.&lt;/li&gt;
